    "title": "Cliffords commuting with $H_*$",
    "full_tex": "With $H_*$ as above, a Hermitian gate $K\\in\\C_2(3)$ commutes with $H_*$ if and only if $K=\\pm(-1)^{ax+bxy+c(1+x)z}$ with $a,b,c\\in\\F_2$. The traceless ones are $\\pm Z_x$ and $\\pm$ two non-Pauli gates whose supports span $L_Z$.\n"
  },
